id": "1ATCNSjXNe", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 35, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "swamp", "id": 8794226, "raw_content": "", "author": "MajorClark", "created": 1787462106903, "profile_picture": "FIsgRa9onFDM", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "okboomer59", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNSjXNe.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/Rx8di3BXwZ2m.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/taFJJaY8DrBpsjI8.png", "width": 768, "content-type": "png", "height": 454}], "blurhash": "UnKBK}IUt7Rj4okDRjj@~qt6RjWBM{oeafWB", "full_resolution": [485, 821]}, "title": "Cutting off USAID was the  best thing President Trump ever did.    All that terrorists activity & money laundering.   They all belong in prison. ", "last_comment_created": 1787477516079, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 4, "score_up": 35, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\u00a0\ud83d\udebd\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0DRAIN THE SWAMP\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\ud83d\udebd\u00a0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCNSk5Tf", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 11, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8794423, "raw_content": "It's been months. He fell back in early June. Went to the ER in pain. They did an x-ray said everything is fine, gave him ibuprofen and a few referrals. \r\n\r\nHe has Medicare. He asked every doctor so far for an MRI and they say no that's \"premature\". They send him to physical therapy or offer more drugs but he doesn't want narcotics. He's been hobbling around for over 2 months. \r\n\r\nYesterday I asked him how it's going he said next appointment for an orthopedist is Sept 4. Said they still won't give him an MRI. His ankle is better but his knee is the size of a kids soccer ball..he showed me. The doctors say it's probably just swelling. \r\n\r\nWe discussed how the second an elite athlete feels a tiny ping they get a full MRI. But my neighbor who is suffering every day cannot get one approved. \r\n\r\nMeanwhile the 3 X-rays he's gotten have likely increased his risk of cancer by multiples. \r\n\r\nI wish there was something I could do for him. It's really messed up when the test he knows he needs is being withheld because of AMA \"guidance\". ", "author": "JoePlumber", "created": 1787486316542, "profile_picture": "WZEHyEIDoCvf", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "CliffordClaven", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The entire US medical system is a scam. My neighbor fell and a twisted his ankle and hurt his knee. Went to the ER they gave him ibuprofen and a series of referrals....all he wants is an MRI and they still refuse. ", "last_comment_created": 1787488041530, "content": "<p>It's been months. He fell back in early June. Went to the ER in pain. They did an x-ray said everything is fine, gave him ibuprofen and a few referrals.</p>\n<p>He has Medicare. He asked every doctor so far for an MRI and they say no that's &quot;premature&quot;. They send him to physical therapy or offer more drugs but he doesn't want narcotics. He's been hobbling around for over 2 months.</p>\n<p>Yesterday I asked him how it's going he said next appointment for an orthopedist is Sept 4. Said they still won't give him an MRI. His ankle is better but his knee is the size of a kids soccer ball..he showed me. The doctors say it's probably just swelling.</p>\n<p>We discussed how the second an elite athlete feels a tiny ping they get a full MRI. But my neighbor who is suffering every day cannot get one approved.</p>\n<p>Meanwhile the 3 X-rays he's gotten have likely increased his risk of cancer by multiples.</p>\n<p>I wish there was something I could do for him. It's really messed up when the test he knows he needs is being withheld because of AMA &quot;guidance&quot;.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 11, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2091153665440792714", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNRas8y", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 511, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8793174, "raw_content": "", "author": "kek_saved_the_world", "created": 1787409389345, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Talon54", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNRas8y.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/EndWokeness/status/2091153665440792714", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "George Floyd got a golden casket. Iryna isn't even allowed to have a mural:", "last_comment_created": 1787458669899, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 34, "score